// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>

/ {
    behaviors {
        hrm_l: hrm_l {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRM_L";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <5 15 26 6 7 8 9 16 17 18 19 27 28 29 30 21 23 22 24 25>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };

        hrm_r: hrm_r {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRM_R";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <21 23 22 24 25 0 10 11 13 3 2 12 1 4 14 20>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
                &kp Q           &kp W              &kp E           &kp R              &kp T    &kp Y      &kp U               &kp I                 &kp O               &kp P
                &hrm_l LCTRL A  &hrm_l LEFT_ALT S  &hrm_l LSHFT D  &hrm_l LEFT_GUI F  &kp G    &kp H      &hrm_r RIGHT_GUI J  &hrm_r RIGHT_SHIFT K  &hrm_r RIGHT_ALT L  &hrm_r RCTRL SEMICOLON
&kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp Z           &kp X              &kp C           &kp V              &kp B    &kp N      &kp M               &kp COMMA             &kp DOT             &kp FSLH                &kp APOS
                                                   &mo 3           &mo 2              &mo 1    &kp SPACE  &mo 1               &kp RETURN
            >;
        };

        nav_num {
            bindings = <
        &kp K_COPY   &kp BACKSPACE  &kp UP     &kp DELETE  &kp PAGE_UP      &kp EQUAL  &kp N7        &kp N8        &kp N9        &trans
        &kp K_PASTE  &kp LEFT       &kp DOWN   &kp RIGHT   &kp PAGE_DOWN    &kp MINUS  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp N5        &kp NUMBER_6  &trans
&trans  &kp K_CUT    &trans         &kp ENTER  &trans      &kp HOME         &kp N0     &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &trans  &trans
                                    &trans     &trans      &trans           &trans     &trans        &trans
            >;
        };

        sym_func {
            bindings = <
           &kp ESC   &kp LEFT_BRACE  &kp RIGHT_BRACE   &none             &none             &kp F1  &kp F2   &kp F3   &kp F4   &trans
           &kp TAB   &kp LBKT        &kp RBKT          &kp ENTER         &kp BSLH          &kp F5  &kp F6   &kp F7   &kp F8   &trans
&kp GRAVE  &kp CLCK  &kp LESS_THAN   &kp GREATER_THAN  &kp GREATER_THAN  &kp UNDERSCORE    &kp F9  &kp F10  &kp F11  &kp F12  &trans  &trans
                                     &trans            &trans            &trans            &none   &none    &none
            >;
        };

        symbols {
            bindings = <
           &kp EXCL  &kp AT      &kp HASH      &kp DOLLAR       &kp PERCENT    &kp CARET  &kp AMPS        &kp ASTRK       &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS
           &trans    &bt BT_CLR  &bt BT_SEL 1  &kp C_VOLUME_UP  &kp C_MUTE     &trans     &mkp LCLK       &mmv MOVE_UP    &mkp RCLK             &trans
&kp TILDE  &trans    &bt BT_NXT  &bt BT_SEL 2  &kp C_VOL_DN     &trans         &trans     &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT       &trans                 &trans
                                 &trans        &trans           &trans         &trans     &trans          &trans
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers {
        compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers";

        device {
            if-layers = <1 2>;
            then-layer = <3>;
        };
    };
};
